 ialah faktor bagi 8.\\nKesimpulan : Semua faktor bagi 8 ialah nombor genap.\"]','[\"text_0\"]','[]','[]','[]','{}','{}','{}','[]','Determine the strength of the inductive argument based on the given premises and conclusion.',0,'boxed text','Easy',1,'A boxed text containing an inductive argument with two premises stating that 2 and 4 are factors of 8, and a conclusion that all factors of 8 are even numbers.','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"d\", \"marks\": 1.0, \"topic\": \"Sets and Logic\", \"target\": \"Determine the strength of the inductive argument based on the given premises and conclusion.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 3: Logical Reasoning\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 5, \"group_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q4\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\"], \"subtopic\": \"Logical Reasoning\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"Form 4\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"4\", \"stage_index\": 2, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"boxed text\", \"given_values\": {}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 1.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Chapter 3: Logical Reasoning\", \"question_type\": \"Inductive Reasoning\", \"verified_form\": \"Form 4\", \"instructions_en\": [\"Determine the strength of the following inductive argument:\\nPremise 1 : 2 is a factor of 8.\\nPremise 2 : 4 is a factor of 8.\\nConclusion : All factors of 8 are an even numbers.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Tentukan kekuatan hujah induktif yang berikut:\\nPremis 1 : 2 ialah faktor bagi 8.\\nPremis 2 : 4 ialah faktor bagi 8.\\nKesimpulan : Semua faktor bagi 8 ialah nombor genap.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 1, \"difficulty_score\": 3.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Moderate\", \"verified_chapter\": \"Chapter 3: Logical Reasoning\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q4_S2\", \"_diagram_public_id\": null, \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"verified\", 