 cat merah ialah RM28 dan cat kuning ialah RM40 lebih daripada cat merah.\", \"Menggunakan kaedah matriks, hitung nilai x dan nilai y.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\"]','[\"2x + y = 28\", \"4x + 3y = 68\"]','[]','[\"x\", \"y\"]','{\"red_paint_large_cans\": 1, \"red_paint_small_cans\": 2, \"red_paint_total_income\": 28, \"yellow_paint_large_cans\": 3, \"yellow_paint_small_cans\": 4, \"yellow_paint_income_more_than_red\": 40}','{}','{}','[]','Calculate the value of x and the value of y using the matrix method.',0,'','Easy',5,'','{\"form\": \"Form 5\", \"part\": \"\", \"marks\": 5.0, \"topic\": \"Algebra\", \"target\": \"Calculate the value of x and the value of y using the matrix method.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 2: Matrices\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 6, \"group_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q5\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Simultaneous Equations\", \"equations\": [\"2x + y = 28\", \"4x + 3y = 68\"], \"variables\": [\"x\", \"y\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"Form 5\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": false, \"question_no\": \"5\", \"stage_index\": 1, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {\"red_paint_large_cans\": 1, \"red_paint_small_cans\": 2, \"red_paint_total_income\": 28, \"yellow_paint_large_cans\": 3, \"yellow_paint_small_cans\": 4, \"yellow_paint_income_more_than_red\": 40}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 6.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Chapter 2: Matrices\", \"question_type\": \"structured\", \"verified_form\": \"Form 5\", \"instructions_en\": [\"Syukri sells red and yellow paint in small and large cans. The selling price of small cans of each colour is RMx and the selling price of large cans of each colour is RMy. Syukri sells 2 small cans and 1 large can of red paint, while 4 small cans of yellow paint and 3 large cans of yellow paint. The total income from the sale of red paint is RM28 and yellow paint is RM40 more than the red paint.\", \"Using the matrix method, calculate the value of x and the value of y.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Syukri menjual cat berwarna merah dan kuning dalam tin kecil dan besar. Harga jualan tin kecil bagi setiap warna ialah RMx dan tin besar bagi setiap warna ialah RMy. Syukri menjual cat berwarna merah yang bersaiz kecil sebanyak 2 tin dan bersaiz besar sebanyak 1 tin, manakala cat berwarna kuning yang bersaiz kecil sebanyak 4 tin dan bersaiz besar sebanyak 3 tin. Jumlah pendapatan hasil jualan cat merah ialah RM28 dan cat kuning ialah RM40 lebih daripada cat merah.\", \"Menggunakan kaedah matriks, hitung nilai x dan nilai y.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 1, \"difficulty_score\": 3.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"verified_chapter\": \"Chapter 2: Matrices\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q5_S1\", \"_diagram_public_id\": null, \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"verified\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 3.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 1, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 0.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.95, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"Syukri sells red and yellow paint in small and large cans. The selling price of small cans of each colour is RMx and the selling price of large cans of each colour is RMy. Syukri sells 2 small cans and 1 large can of red paint, while 4 small cans of yellow paint and 3 large cans of yellow paint. The total income from the sale of red paint is RM28 and yellow paint is RM40 more than the red paint.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Syukri menjual cat berwarna merah dan kuning dalam tin kecil dan besar. Harga jualan tin kecil bagi setiap warna ialah RMx dan tin besar bagi setiap warna ialah RMy. Syukri menjual cat berwarna merah yang bersaiz kecil sebanyak 2 tin dan bersaiz besar sebanyak 1 tin, manakala cat berwarna kuning yang bersaiz kecil sebanyak 4 tin dan bersaiz besar sebanyak 3 tin. Jumlah pendapatan hasil jualan cat merah ialah RM28 dan cat kuning ialah RM40 lebih daripada cat merah.\"}',NULL,'2026-05-08 09:24:56','Johor_2025_Q5','Form 5','Chapter 2: Matrices','verified',0.95,1,1,'Chapter 2: Matrices','Form 5','Johor_2025_Q5_S1',1,'',6.00,'marking_scheme',1),(820,39,'6','a','','','structured','Graphs of Motion','Graphs of Motion','Form 4','Chapter 7: Graphs of Motion','[\"Diagram 4 shows the distance-time graph for the journey of two tour buses between Kuala Lumpur and Johor Bahru for a distance of 350 km. Both buses pass the same road at the same time. The KL graph shows the journey of bus X from Kuala Lumpur to Johor Bahru while the OMNP graph shows the journey of bus Y from Johor Bahru to Kuala Lumpur.\", \"Calculate the time in minutes that the bus Y stops.\"]','[\"Rajah 4 menunjukkan graf jarak-masa perjalanan dua buah bas persiaran di antara Kuala Lumpur dengan Johor Bahru bagi jarak sejauh 350 km. Kedua-dua bas melalui jalan yang sama pada masa yang sama. Graf KL menunjukkan perjalanan bas X dari Kuala Lumpur ke Johor Bahru manakala graf OMNP menunjukkan perjalanan bas Y dari Johor Bahru ke Kuala Lumpur.\", \"Hitung tempoh masa, dalam minit bas Y itu berhenti.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\"]','[]','[]','[\"time\", \"distance\", \"speed\"]','{\"time_points_hours\": [0, 1, 2.5, 3, 4], \"total_distance_km\": 350, \"distance_points_km\": [0, 110, 350]}','{}','{}','[]','Calculate the time in minutes that the bus Y stops.',1,'distance-time graph','Easy',1,'A distance-time graph showing two buses traveling between Kuala Lumpur and Johor Bahru over 350 km. The graph includes two lines: KL representing bus X\'s journey from Kuala Lumpur to Johor Bahru, and OMNP representing bus Y\'s journey from Johor Bahru to Kuala Lumpur, with key points marked at times 1 hour, 2.5 hours, 3 hours, and 4 hours.','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 1.0, \"topic\": \"Graphs of Motion\", \"target\": \"Calculate the time in minutes that the bus Y stops.\"