epada 40 orang ahlinya. Sebanyak 17 orang bermain ceper (P), 25 orang bermain batu seremban (B), 18 orang bermain congkak (C), 8 orang bermain ceper dan batu seremban, 12 orang bermain batu seremban dan congkak, dan 3 orang bermain ceper, congkak dan batu seremban.\", \"Jika bilangan ahli yang hanya bermain batu seremban ialah dua kali bilangan ahli yang hanya bermain congkak, lukiskan gambar rajah Venn yang dapat mewakili set seperti yang dinyatakan.\", \"Seterusnya, nyatakan bilangan ahli yang yang hanya bermain batu seremban Sahaja.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"]','[]','[\"P\", \"B\", \"C\"]','[\"P\", \"B\", \"C\"]','{\"B\": 25, \"C\": 18, \"P\": 17, \"B_and_C\": 12, \"P_and_B\": 8, \"P_and_C_and_B\": 3, \"total_members\": 40, \"B_only_twice_C_only\": true}','{}','{}','[]','Draw a Venn diagram representing the sets and state the number of members who play batu seremban only.',1,'Venn diagram','Moderate',5,'A Venn diagram involving three sets P, B, and C representing members playing ceper, batu seremban, and congkak respectively, with intersections representing members playing multiple games.','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"b\", \"marks\": 5.0, \"topic\": \"Sets and Logic\", \"target\": \"Draw a Venn diagram representing the sets and state the number of members who play batu seremban only.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 4: Operations on Sets\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 14, \"group_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q11\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"], \"subtopic\": \"Sets\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"P\", \"B\", \"C\"], \"difficulty\": \"Moderate\", \"group_form\": \"Form 4\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [\"P\", \"B\", \"C\"], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"11\", \"stage_index\": 2, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"Venn diagram\", \"given_values\": {\"B\": 25, \"C\": 18, \"P\": 17, \"B_and_C\": 12, \"P_and_B\": 8, \"P_and_C_and_B\": 3, \"total_members\": 40, \"B_only_twice_C_only\": true}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 5.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Chapter 4: Operations on Sets\", \"question_type\": \"Structured\", \"verified_form\": \"Form 4\", \"instructions_en\": [\"The History Society has introduced traditional games to 40 of its members. A total of 17 people play ceper (P), 25 people play batu seremban (B), 18 people play congkak (C), 8 people play ceper and batu seremban, 12 people play batu seremban and congkak, and 3 people play ceper, congkak and batu seremban.\", \"If the number of members who play batu seremban only is twice the number of members who only play congkak, draw a Venn diagram that can represent the set as stated.\", \"Hence, state the number of members who play batu seremban only.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Persatuan Sejarah telah memperkenalkan permainan tradisional kepada 40 orang ahlinya. Sebanyak 17 orang bermain ceper (P), 25 orang bermain batu seremban (B), 18 orang bermain congkak (C), 8 orang bermain ceper dan batu seremban, 12 orang bermain batu seremban dan congkak, dan 3 orang bermain ceper, congkak dan batu seremban.\", \"Jika bilangan ahli yang hanya bermain batu seremban ialah dua kali bilangan ahli yang hanya bermain congkak, lukiskan gambar rajah Venn yang dapat mewakili set seperti yang dinyatakan.\", \"Seterusnya, nyatakan bilangan ahli yang yang hanya bermain batu seremban Sahaja.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 3, \"difficulty_score\": 5.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Hard\", \"verified_chapter\": \"Chapter 4: Operations on Sets\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q11_S2\", \"_diagram_public_id\": null, \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"verified\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 4.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q11_S1\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 5, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 1.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"A Venn diagram involving three sets P, B, and C representing members playing ceper, batu seremban, and congkak respectively, with intersections representing members playing multiple games.\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.95, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"The History Society has introduced traditional games to 40 of its members. A total of 17 people play ceper (P), 25 people play batu seremban (B), 18 people play congkak (C), 8 people play ceper and batu seremban, 12 people play batu seremban and congkak, and 3 people play ceper, congkak and batu seremban.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Persatuan Sejarah telah memperkenalkan permainan tradisional kepada 40 orang ahlinya. Sebanyak 17 orang bermain ceper (P), 25 orang bermain batu seremban (B), 18 orang bermain congkak (C), 8 orang bermain ceper dan batu seremban, 12 orang bermain batu seremban dan congkak, dan 3 orang bermain ceper, congkak dan batu seremban.\"}',NULL,'2026-05-08 09:24:56','Johor_2025_Q11','Form 4','Chapter 4: Operations on Sets','verified',0.95,3,5,'Chapter 4: Operations on Sets','Form 4','Johor_2025_Q11_S2',2,'Johor_2025_Q11_S1',5.00,'marking_scheme',1),(833,39,'12','a','','','structured','Equations and Inequalities','Linear Inequalities','Form 4','Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables','[\"The Science Society and the Mathematics Society of SMK Bestari are planning to held a tour to Petrosains in Kuala Lumpur. The tour program is open to all members of both societies subject to the following conditions:\\n- The maximum number of participants is 70 students only.\\n- The number of members of the Mathematics Society in this program is at least 10 students more than the members of the Science Society.\\nGiven x is the number of members of the Science Society and y is the number of members of the Mathematics Society involved in the program, write two linear inequalities, other than x ≥ 0 and y ≥ 0, that represent the situation.\", \"Fill in the blank with the symbol \'<\' or \'>\' to form a correct mathematical statement.\", \"(x + 4) [blank] (x + 3)\"]','[\"Persatuan Sains dan Persatuan Matematik SMK Bestari merancang untuk mengadakan lawatan ke Petrosains di Kuala Lumpur. Program lawatan tersebut terbuka untuk disertai oleh semua ahli kedua-dua persatuan tersebut tertakluk kepada beberapa syarat berikut:\\n- Jumlah maksimum peserta ialah 70 orang murid sahaja.\\n- Bilangan ahli Persatuan Matematik dalam program ini adalah sekurang-kurangnya 10 orang murid melebihi ahli Persatuan Sains.\\nDiberi x ialah bilangan ahli Persatuan Sains dan y ialah bilangan ahli Persatuan Matematik yang terlibat dalam program lawatan, tulis dua ketaksamaan linear, selain daripada x ≥ 0 dan y ≥ 0 yang mewakili situasi tersebut.\", \"Isikan petak kosong dengan simbol \'<\' atau \'>\' bagi membentuk satu pernyataan matematik yang benar.\", \"(x + 4) [kosong] (x + 3)\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"]','[]','[\"(x + 4)\", \"(x + 3)\"]','[\"x\"]','{}','{}','{}','[\"\'<\'\", \"\'>\'\"]','Fill in the blank with the symbol \'<\' or \'>\' to form a correct mathematical statement between (x + 4) and (x + 3).',1,'box for symbol input','Easy',1,'A box is placed between the expressions (x + 4) and (x + 3) indicating a comparison symbol is to be inserted.','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 1.0, \"topic\": \"Equations and Inequalities\", \"target\": \"Fill in the blank with the symbol \'<\' or \'>\' to form a correct mathematical statement between (x + 4) and (x + 3).\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables\", \"options\": [\"\'<\'\", \"\'>\'\"], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 16, \"group_id\": \"Johor_2025_Q12\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"], \"subtopic\": \"Linear Inequalities\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"x\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"Form 4\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [\"(x + 4)\", \"(x + 3)\"], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"12\", \"stage_index\": 1, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"box for symbol input\", \"given_values\":