an di Kuala Lumpur. Mereka hanya melawati setiap tempat sekali sahaja.\"}','https://res.cloudinary.com/dfzojq6t7/image/upload/v1778245974/Screenshot_2026-05-08_211241_oiwv7u.png','2026-05-08 09:38:29','Perak_2025_Q7','Form 4','Chapter 5: Network in Graph Theory','verified',0.95,2,5,'Chapter 5: Congruency, Enlargement and Combined Transformations','Form 5','Perak_2025_Q7_S1',1,'',4.00,'marking_scheme',1),(869,41,'8','a','','','Structured','Equations and Inequalities','Linear Inequalities','Form 4','Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables','[\"Puan Irdina wishes to donate nasi kerabu for the year-end banquet of SMK Damai Form 5 students. The number of nasi kerabu to be donated is at most of 80 sets. The number of students who eat chicken nasi kerabu is at least twice the number of students who eat meat nasi kerabu.\", \"The variable x represents kerabu meat rice while the variable y represents kerabu chicken rice. Write two linear inequalities other than x ≥ 0 and y ≥ 0 that represent the conditions for the donation of the rice kerabu.\"]','[\"Puan Irdina berhasrat memberikan sumbangan nasi kerabu untuk jamuan akhir tahun murid-murid Tingkatan 5 SMK Damai. Jumlah nasi kerabu yang hendak disumbangkan adalah selebih-lebihnya 80 set. Bilangan murid yang makan nasi kerabu ayam adalah sekurang-kurangnya dua kali bilangan murid yang makan nasi kerabu daging.\", \"Pemboleh ubah x mewakili nasi kerabu daging manakala pemboleh ubah y mewakili nasi kerabu ayam. Tulis dua ketaksamaan linear selain x ≥ 0 dan y ≥ 0 yang mewakili syarat-syarat sumbangan nasi kerabu tersebut.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\"]','[]','[\"x ≥ 0\", \"y ≥ 0\"]','[\"x\", \"y\"]','{\"max_total_nasi_kerabu\": 80}','{}','{}','[]','Write two linear inequalities other than x ≥ 0 and y ≥ 0 that represent the conditions for the donation of the rice kerabu.',0,'','Easy',2,'','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 2.0, \"topic\": \"Equations and Inequalities\", \"target\": \"Write two linear inequ