 Inequalities','Linear Inequalities','Form 4','Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables','[\"On Cooperative Day, the STEM Club sells x souvenirs A and y souvenirs B. Profits of RM 4 and RM 5 respectively are obtained from the sale of each souvenir A and B. The number of souvenirs A sold is at least equal to the number of souvenirs B sold. The total number of souvenirs A and B sold is at most 15. The STEM Club wants to earn a minimum profit of RM 40.\", \"Write a condition that represents the linear inequality (ii).\"]','[\"Pada Hari Koperasi, Kelab STEM menjual x cenderamata A dan y cenderamata B. Keuntungan sebanyak RM 4 dan RM 5 masing-masing diperoleh daripada jualan setiap cenderamata A dan B. Bilangan cenderamata A yang dijual sekurang-kurangnya sama dengan bilangan cenderamata B yang dijual. Jumlah bilangan cenderamata A dan B yang dijual selebih-lebihnya 15. Kelab STEM ingin memperoleh keuntungan minimum RM 40.\", \"Tulis satu syarat yang mewakili ketaksamaan linear (ii).\"]','[\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"]','[\"x + y \\\\leq 15\"]','[]','[\"x\", \"y\"]','{}','{\"Table 4\": [[\"Syarat\\nCondition\", \"Ketaksamaan linear\\nLinear inequality\"], [\"(i) Bilangan cenderamata A yang dijual sekurang-kurangnya sama dengan bilangan cenderamata B yang dijual\\nThe number of souvenirs A sold is at least equal to the number of souvenirs B sold.\", \"x \\\\geq y\"], [\"(ii)\", \"x + y \\\\leq 15\"], [\"(iii) Keuntungan minimum ialah RM 40.\\nThe minimum profit is RM 40.\", \"\"]]}','{}','[]','',1,'Graph','Moderate',1,'A table showing conditions and corresponding linear inequalities related to souvenirs A and B.','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 1.0, \"topic\": \"Equations and Inequalities\", \"target\": \"\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"i\", \"_page_no\": 24, \"group_id\": \"Penang_2025_Q14\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Linear I