 400.\\n- Bilangan bekas biskut Jejari Emas melebihi bilangan bekas biskut Nilam Sari dengan selebih-lebihnya 200 bekas.\", \"Diberi pemboleh ubah x mewakili bekas biskut Nilam Sari dan pemboleh ubah y mewakili bekas biskut Jejari Emas. Tulis tiga ketaksamaan linear, selain x ≥ 0 dan y ≥ 0, yang memenuhi semua kekangan berikut.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\"]','[]','[\"x ≥ 0\", \"y ≥ 0\"]','[\"x\", \"y\"]','{}','{}','{\"x < 250\": \"The number of Nilam Sari biscuit containers is less than 250\", \"x + y ≤ 400\": \"The total number of biscuit containers does not exceed 400\", \"y - x ≤ 200\": \"The number of Jejari Emas biscuit containers exceeds the number of Nilam Sari biscuit containers by at most 200\"}','[]','Write three linear inequalities, other than x ≥ 0 and y ≥ 0, that satisfy all of the given constraints.',0,'','Easy',3,'','{\"form\": \"Form 4\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 3.0, \"topic\": \"Equations and Inequalities\", \"target\": \"Write three linear inequalities, other than x ≥ 0 and y ≥ 0, that satisfy all of the given constraints.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 29, \"group_id\": \"Kedah_2025_Q15\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Linear Inequalities\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"x\", \"y\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"Form 4\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {\"x < 250\": \"The number of Nilam Sari biscuit containers is less than 250\", \"x + y ≤ 400\": \"The total number of biscuit containers does not exceed 400\", \"y - x ≤ 200\": \"The number of Jejari Emas biscuit containers exceeds the number of Nilam Sari biscuit containers by at most 200\"}, \"expressions\": [\"x ≥ 0\", \"y ≥ 0\"], \"has_diagram\": false, \"question_no\": \"15\", \"stage_index\": 1, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 3.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Chap