tan bertuah sempena pembukaan sebuah bakeri. Pada suatu hari tertentu, Lisa membeli 3 keping pizza dan 6 biji kek cawan dengan menggunakan baucar pertama yang bernilai RM45. Keesokan harinya, adiknya membeli 7 keping pizza dengan menggunakan baucar kedua yang juga bernilai RM45. Walau bagaimanapun, nilai baucar kedua itu tidak mencukupi dan dia perlu menambah sejumlah wang tunai yang bersamaan dengan harga sebiji kek cawan.\", \"Menggunakan kaedah matriks, cari harga, dalam RM, sekeping pizza dan sebiji kek cawan.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\"]','[]','[]','[\"price of a slice of pizza\", \"price of a cupcake\"]','{\"day_1_purchase\": \"3 slices of pizza and 6 cupcakes\", \"day_2_purchase\": \"7 slices of pizza\", \"voucher_1_value\": \"RM45\", \"voucher_2_value\": \"RM45\", \"total_value_vouchers\": \"RM125\", \"cupcakes_bought_by_Lisa\": 6, \"pizza_slices_bought_by_Lisa\": 3, \"pizza_slices_bought_by_sister\": 7}','{}','{}','[]','Find the price of a slice of pizza and a cupcake using matrix method.',0,'','Easy',6,'','{\"form\": \"Form 5\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 6.0, \"topic\": \"Matrices\", \"target\": \"Find the price of a slice of pizza and a cupcake using matrix method.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 2: Matrices\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 16, \"group_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q14\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Matrix Operations\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"price of a slice of pizza\", \"price of a cupcake\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"Form 5\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": false, \"question_no\": \"14\", \"stage_index\": 1, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {\"day_1_purchase\": \"3 slices of pizza and 6 cupcakes\", \"day_2_purchase\": \"7 slices of pizza\", \"voucher_1_value\": \"RM45\", \"voucher_2_value\": \"RM45\", \"total_value_vouchers\": \"RM125\", \"cupcakes_bought_by_Lisa\": 6, \"pizza_slices_bought_by