otal value of RM125 in a lucky draw in conjunction with the opening of a bakery. On a particular day, Lisa buys 3 slices of pizzas and 6 cupcakes by using the first voucher worth RM45. The next day, her sister buys 7 slices of pizzas by using the second voucher also worth RM45. However, the value of the second voucher is insufficient and she needs to add some cash which is equal to the price of a cupcake.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Lisa dan adiknya memenangi tiga keping baucar yang nilainya berjumlah RM125 dalam suatu cabutan bertuah sempena pembukaan sebuah bakeri. Pada suatu hari tertentu, Lisa membeli 3 keping pizza dan 6 biji kek cawan dengan menggunakan baucar pertama yang bernilai RM45. Keesokan harinya, adiknya membeli 7 keping pizza dengan menggunakan baucar kedua yang juga bernilai RM45. Walau bagaimanapun, nilai baucar kedua itu tidak mencukupi dan dia perlu menambah sejumlah wang tunai yang bersamaan dengan harga sebiji kek cawan.\"}',NULL,'2026-05-09 19:34:24','SPM_2021_Q14','Form 5','Chapter 2: Matrices','verified',0.95,2,4,'Chapter 2: Matrices','Form 5','SPM_2021_Q14_S1',1,'',6.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1088,49,'14','b','','','Structured','Matrices','Matrix Operations','Form 5','Chapter 2: Matrices','[\"Lisa and her sister won three vouchers with the total value of RM125 in a lucky draw in conjunction with the opening of a bakery. On a particular day, Lisa buys 3 slices of pizzas and 6 cupcakes by using the first voucher worth RM45. The next day, her sister buys 7 slices of pizzas by using the second voucher also worth RM45. However, the value of the second voucher is insufficient and she needs to add some cash which is equal to the price of a cupcake.\", \"The following week, Lisa and her sister want to use the third voucher to buy 4 pieces of pizza and 2 cupcakes.\", \"Is the value of the third voucher sufficient for them to buy the pizza and the cupcakes? Justify your answer by using matrix multiplication only.\"]','[\"Lisa dan adiknya memenangi tiga keping baucar yang nilainya berjumlah RM125 dalam suatu cabutan bertuah sempena pembukaan sebuah bakeri. Pada suatu hari tertentu, Lisa membeli 3 keping pizza dan 6 biji kek cawan dengan menggunakan baucar pertama yang bernilai RM45. Keesokan harinya, adiknya membeli 7 keping pizza dengan menggunakan baucar kedua yang juga bernilai RM45. Walau bagaimanapun, nilai baucar kedua itu tidak mencukupi dan dia perlu menambah sejumlah wang tunai yang bersamaan dengan harga sebiji kek cawan.\", \"Pada minggu seterusnya, Lisa dan adiknya ingin menggunakan baucar ketiga untuk membeli 4 keping pizza dan 2 biji kek cawan.\", \"Adakah nilai baucar ketiga ini cukup untuk mereka membeli pizza dan kek cawan itu? Justifikasi jawapan anda dengan menggunakan pendaraban matriks sahaja.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"]','[]','[]','[\"value of third voucher\", \"price of a slice of pizza\", \"price of a cupcake\"]','{\"voucher_1_value\": \"RM45\", \"voucher_2_value\": \"RM45\", \"voucher_3_value\": \"unknown\", \"total_value_vouchers\": \"RM125\", \"third_voucher_purchase\": \"4 pieces of pizza and 2 cupcakes\", \"cupcakes_bought_by_Lisa\": 6, \"pizza_slices_bought_by_Lisa\": 3, \"cupcakes_to_buy_third_voucher\": 2, \"pizza_slices_bought_by_sister\": 7, \"pizza_slices_to_buy_third_voucher\": 4}','{}','{}','[]','Determine if the third voucher value is sufficient to buy 4 slices of pizza and 2 cupcakes using matrix multiplication.',0,'','Easy',3,'','{\"form\": \"Form 5\", \"part\": \"b\", \"marks\": 3.0, \"topic\": \"Matrices\", \"target\": \"Determine if the third voucher value is sufficient to buy 4 slices of pizza and 2 cupcakes using matrix multiplication.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 2: Matrices\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 16, \"group_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q14\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"], \"subtopic\": \"Matrix Operations\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"value of third voucher\", \"price of a slice of pizza\", \"pri