akan berlari sejauh 10 km sebagai salah satu latihan kecergasannya. Rajah 7 menunjukkan graf jarak-masa bagi larian Reza pada suatu hujung minggu tertentu.\"}','https://res.cloudinary.com/dfzojq6t7/image/upload/v1778359927/Screenshot_2026-05-10_045157_c9gbax.png','2026-05-09 19:34:24','SPM_2021_Q16','Form 4','Chapter 7: Graphs of Motion','verified',0.95,1,2,'Mixed','','SPM_2021_Q16_S1',1,'',2.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1096,49,'16','b','','','Structured','Statistics','Data Handling','Foundation','Foundation: Geometry','[\"As an athlete, Reza has to control his diet. The total calories that he should take is 3 000 calories per day. Diagram 8 shows a pie chart of nutrition which becomes Reza\'s reference.\", \"It is given that protein intake is 250 calories and the difference of angle of sector between sodium and calcium intakes is 36°. The angle of sector of fat intake is 11°.\", \"Find the angle of sector representing the calcium intake.\"]','[\"Sebagai seorang atlet, Reza perlu mengawal dietnya. Jumlah kalori yang perlu diambilnya ialah 3 000 kalori sehari. Rajah 8 menunjukkan carta pai bagi nutrisi yang menjadi rujukan Reza.\", \"Diberi bahawa pengambilan protein adalah sebanyak 250 kalori dan beza antara sudut sektor bagi pengambilan natrium dan kalsium ialah 36°. Sudut sektor bagi pengambilan lemak ialah 11°.\", \"Cari sudut sektor yang mewakili pengambilan kalsium.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"]','[\"Total calories = 3000\", \"Protein intake = 250 calories\", \"Difference of angle between sodium and calcium = 36°\", \"Angle of fat intake = 11°\", \"Angle of sector representing calcium intake = ?\"]','[]','[\"protein intake\", \"sodium intake\", \"calcium intake\", \"fat intake\", \"total calories\"]','{\"total_calories\": 3000, \"angle_fat_intake\": 11, \"protein_calories\": 250, \"angle_carbohydrate_intake\": 209, \"angle_difference_sodium_calcium\": 36}','{}','{}','[]','Find the angle of sector representing the calcium intake.',1,'pie chart','Easy',4,'A pie chart showing the distribution of nutrition intake for an athlete, with sectors labeled for fat, protein, calcium, sodium, and carbohydrate. The carbohydrate sector is the largest with an angle of 209°, and other sectors are marked with their respective nutrients.','{\"form\": \"Foundation\", \"part\": \"b\", \"marks\": 4.0, \"topic\": \"Statistics\", \"target\": \"Find the angle of sector representing the calcium intake.\", \"chapter\": \"Foundation: Geometry\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 22, \"group_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"], \"subtopic\": \"Data Handling\", \"equations\": [\"Total calories = 3000\", \"Protein intake = 250 calories\", \"Difference of angle between sodium and calcium = 36°\", \"Angle of fat intake = 11°\", \"Angle of sector representing calcium intake = ?\"], \"variables\": [\"protein intake\", \"sodium intake\", \"calcium intake\", \"fat intake\", \"total calories\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"16\", \"stage_index\": 2, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"pie chart\", \"given_values\": {\"total_calories\": 3000, \"angle_fat_intake\": 11, \"protein_calories\": 250, \"angle_carbohydrate_intake\": 209, \"angle_difference_sodium_calcium\": 36}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 4.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Mixed\", \"question_type\": \"Structured\", \"verified_form\": \"Foundation\", \"instructions_en\": [\"As an athlete, Reza has to control his diet. The total calories that he should take is 3 000 calories per day. Diagram 8 shows a pie chart of nutrition which becomes Reza\'s reference.\", \"It is given that protein intake is 250 calories and the difference of angle of sector between sodium and calcium intakes is 36°. The angle of sector of fat intake is 11°.\", \"Find the angle of sector representing the calcium intake.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Sebagai seorang atlet, Reza perlu mengawal dietnya. Jumlah kalori yang perlu diambilnya ialah 3 000 kalori sehari. Rajah 8 menunjukkan carta pai bagi nutrisi yang menjadi rujukan Reza.\", \"Diberi bahawa pengambilan protein adalah sebanyak 250 kalori dan beza antara sudut sektor bagi pengambilan natrium dan kalsium ialah 36°. Sudut sektor bagi pengambilan lemak ialah 11°.\", \"Cari sudut sektor yang mewakili pengambilan kalsium.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 1, \"difficulty_score\": 3.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Hard\", \"verified_chapter\": \"Foundation: Geometry\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16_S2\", \"_diagram_public_id\": \"mathsy/question_diagrams/xnfgadf9mgdo6wjtc42n\", \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"foundation_verified\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 2.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16_S1\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 5, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 1.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"A pie chart showing the distribution of nutrition intake for an athlete, with sectors labeled for fat, protein, calcium, sodium, and carbohydrate. The carbohydrate sector is the largest with an angle of 209°, and other sectors are marked with their respective nutrients.\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.85, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"As an athlete, Reza has to control his diet. The total calories that he should take is 3 000 calories per day. Diagram 8 shows a pie chart of nutrition which becomes Reza\'s reference.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Sebagai seorang atlet, Reza perlu mengawal dietnya. Jumlah kalori yang perlu diambilnya ialah 3 000 kalori sehari. Rajah 8 menunjukkan carta pai bagi nutrisi yang menjadi rujukan Reza.\"}','https://res.cloudinary.com/dfzojq6t7/image/upload/v1778354845/mathsy/question_diagrams/xnfgadf9mgdo6wjtc42n.jpg','2026-05-09 19:34:24','SPM_2021_Q16','Foundation','Foundation: Geometry','foundation_verified',0.85,1,5,'Mixed','','SPM_2021_Q16_S2',2,'SPM_2021_Q16_S1',4.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1097,49,'16','c','','','Structured','Trigonometry','Trigonometric Ratios','Foundation','Foundation: Geometry','[\"In order to improve Reza\'s smash skill, his coach has set up a drill where Reza needs to jump at point R and smashes to markers, M and N. Diagram 9(a) shows the positions of point R, markers M and N which lie on a horizontal surface of a badminton court. Diagram 9(b) shows the vertical height measured from Reza\'s shoes, Q to the hitting point, P on his racquet during his smashes.\", \"It is given that the distance of point R from markers, M and N is the same, ∠MRN = 38° and distance of MN is 4 m. Point R, marker M and marker N form an isosceles triangle.\", \"Calculate the difference between angle of depression of marker M and marker N from point P when Reza makes a vertical jump of 0.25 m and 0.15 m at point R respectively during the smashes.\"]','[\"Untuk meningkatkan kemahiran pukulan junam Reza, jurulatihnya telah merangka satu latihan iaitu Reza perlu melompat pada titik R dan membuat pukulan junam ke penanda M dan penanda N. Rajah 9(a) menunjukkan kedudukan titik R, penanda M dan penanda N yang berada pada permukaan mengufuk sebuah gelanggang badminton. Rajah 9(b) menunjukkan tinggi tegak yang diukur dari kasut Reza, Q ke titik pukulan, P pada raketnya ketika melakukan pukulan junam.\", \"Diberi bahawa jarak titik R dari penanda M dan penanda N adalah sama, ∠MRN = 38° dan jarak MN ialah 4 m. Titik R, penanda M dan penanda N membentuk segi tiga sama kaki.\", \"Hitung beza antara sudut tunduk penanda M dan penanda N dari titik P apabila Reza membuat lompatan tegak masing-masing 0.25 m dan 0.15 m pada titik R ketika melakukan pukulan junam.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"]','[\"∠MRN = 38°\", \"MN = 4 m\", \"vertical jump M = 0.25 m\", \"vertical jump N = 0.15 m\"]','[]','[\"R\", \"M\", \"N\", \"P\", \"Q\"]','{\"angle_MRN\": \"38°\", \"distance_MN\": \"4 m\", \"vertical_jump_M\": \"0.25 m\", \"vertical_jump_N\": \"0.15 m\"}','{}','{}','[]','Calculate the difference between angle of depression of marker M and marker N from point P during the smashes.',1,'Geometry figure','Easy',3,'Diagram 9(a) shows a badminton court with points R, M, and N forming an isosceles triangle on a horizontal surface. Diagram 9(b) shows a vertical height of 2.4 m from Reza\'s shoes (Q) to the hitting point (P) on his racquet during a jump.','{\"form\": \"Foundation\", \"part\": \"c\", \"marks\": 3.0, \"topic\": \"Trigonometry\", \"target\": \"Calculate the difference between angle of depression of marker M and marker N from point P during the smashes.\", \"chapter\": \"Foundation: Geometry\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 23, \"group_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\", \"text_2\"], \"subtopic\": \"Trigonometric Ratios\", \"equations\": [\"∠MRN = 38°\", \"MN = 4 m\", \"vertical jump M = 0.25 m\", \"vertical jump N = 0.15 m\"], \"variables\": [\"R\", \"M\", \"N\", \"P\", \"Q\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"16\", \"stage_index\": 3, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"Geometry figure\", \"given_values\": {\"angle_MRN\": \"38°\", \"distance_MN\": \"4 m\", \"vertical_jump_M\": \"0.25 m\", \"vertical_jump_N\": \"0.15 m\"}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 3.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Mixed\", \"question_type\": \"Structured\", \"verified_form\": \"Foundation\", \"instructions_en\": [\"In order to improve Reza\'s smash skill, his coach has set up a drill where Reza needs to jump at point R and smashes to markers, M and N. Diagram 9(a) shows the positions of point R, markers M and N which lie on a horizontal surface of a badminton court. Diagram 9(b) shows the vertical height measured from Reza\'s shoes, Q to the hitting point, P on his racquet during his smashes.\", \"It is given that the distance of point R from markers, M and N is the same, ∠MRN = 38° and distance of MN is 4 m. Point R, marker M and marker N form an isosceles triangle.\", \"Calculate the difference between angle of depression of marker M and marker N from point P when Reza makes a vertical jump of 0.25 m and 0.15 m at point R respectively during the smashes.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Untuk meningkatkan kemahiran pukulan junam Reza, jurulatihnya telah merangka satu latihan iaitu Reza perlu melompat pada titik R dan membuat pukulan junam ke penanda M dan penanda N. Rajah 9(a) menunjukkan kedudukan titik R, penanda M dan penanda N yang berada pada permukaan mengufuk sebuah gelanggang badminton. Rajah 9(b) menunjukkan tinggi tegak yang diukur dari kasut Reza, Q ke titik pukulan, P pada raketnya ketika melakukan pukulan junam.\", \"Diberi bahawa jarak titik R dari penanda M dan penanda N adalah sama, ∠MRN = 38° dan jarak MN ialah 4 m. Titik R, penanda M dan penanda N membentuk segi tiga sama kaki.\", \"Hitung beza antara sudut tunduk penanda M dan penanda N dari titik P apabila Reza membuat lompatan tegak masing-masing 0.25 m dan 0.15 m pada titik R ketika melakukan pukulan junam.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 1, \"difficulty_score\": 3.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Hard\", \"verified_chapter\": \"Foundation: Geometry\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16_S3\", \"_diagram_public_id\": \"mathsy/question_diagrams/azfwpddrx4ssgvbcivhf\", \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"foundation_verified\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 2.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16_S2\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 5, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 1.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"Diagram 9(a) shows a badminton court with points R, M, and N forming an isosceles triangle on a horizontal surface. Diagram 9(b) shows a vertical height of 2.4 m from Reza\'s shoes (Q) to the hitting point (P) on his racquet during a jump.\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.85, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"In order to improve Reza\'s smash skill, his coach has set up a drill where Reza needs to jump at point R and smashes to markers, M and N. Diagram 9(a) shows the positions of point R, markers M and N which lie on a horizontal surface of a badminton court. Diagram 9(b) shows the vertical height measured from Reza\'s shoes, Q to the hitting point, P on his racquet during his smashes.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Untuk meningkatkan kemahiran pukulan junam Reza, jurulatihnya telah merangka satu latihan iaitu Reza perlu melompat pada titik R dan membuat pukulan junam ke penanda M dan penanda N. Rajah 9(a) menunjukkan kedudukan titik R, penanda M dan penanda N yang berada pada permukaan mengufuk sebuah gelanggang badminton. Rajah 9(b) menunjukkan tinggi tegak yang diukur dari kasut Reza, Q ke titik pukulan, P pada raketnya ketika melakukan pukulan junam.\"}','https://res.cloudinary.com/dfzojq6t7/image/upload/v1778354846/mathsy/question_diagrams/azfwpddrx4ssgvbcivhf.jpg','2026-05-09 19:34:24','SPM_2021_Q16','Foundation','Foundation: Geometry','foundation_verified',0.85,1,5,'Mixed','','SPM_2021_Q16_S3',3,'SPM_2021_Q16_S2',3.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1098,49,'16','d','','','structured','Statistics','Data Handling','','','[\"Reza wants to buy a new racquet that will be used in that tournament. After doing some surveys, he identifies two types of racquets, S and T which are suitable with his playing style. Table 5 shows the data about the shuttlecock speeds when smashed using racquets S and T from a website.\", \"Based on the data, which racquet should Reza buy? Justify your answer.\"]','[\"Reza ingin membeli sebatang raket baharu yang akan digunakan dalam pertandingan itu. Setelah membuat tinjauan, dia mendapati dua jenis raket iaitu S dan T adalah sesuai dengan gaya permainannya. Jadual 5 menunjukkan data tentang laju bulu tangkis yang dipukul junam menggunakan raket S dan raket T daripada suatu laman web.\", \"Berdasarkan data tersebut, raket manakah yang patut Reza beli? Justifikasi jawapan anda.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"]','[]','[]','[\"S\", \"T\"]','{\"Table 5\": [[\"Jenis Raket\\nType of Racquet\", \"Laju bulu tangkis (km h⁻¹)\\nSpeed of the shuttlecock (km h⁻¹)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"], [\"\", \"Percubaan\\nTrial\", \"1\", \"2\", \"3\", \"4\", \"5\"], [\"S\", \"\", \"254\", \"251\", \"256\", \"260\", \"253\"], [\"T\", \"\", \"252\", \"255\", \"258\", \"254\", \"255\"]]}','{\"Table 5\": [[\"Jenis Raket\\nType of Racquet\", \"Laju bulu tangkis (km h⁻¹)\\nSpeed of the shuttlecock (km h⁻¹)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"], [\"\", \"Percubaan\\nTrial\", \"1\", \"2\", \"3\", \"4\", \"5\"], [\"S\", \"\", \"254\", \"251\", \"256\", \"260\", \"253\"], [\"T\", \"\", \"252\", \"255\", \"258\", \"254\", \"255\"]]}','{}','[]','Determine which racquet, S or T, Reza should buy based on the shuttlecock speed data and justify the choice.',1,'table','Moderate',5,'A table comparing shuttlecock speeds (km/h) for two racquets, S and T, across five trials, showing numerical speed data for each trial.','{\"form\": \"\", \"part\": \"d\", \"marks\": 5.0, \"topic\": \"Statistics\", \"target\": \"Determine which racquet, S or T, Reza should buy based on the shuttlecock speed data and justify the choice.\", \"chapter\": \"\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 24, \"group_id\": \"SPM_2021_Q16\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Data Handling\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"S\", \"T\"], \"difficulty\": \"Moderate\", \"group_form\": \"\", \"table_data\": {\"Table 5\": [[\"Jenis Raket\\nType of Racquet\", \"Laju bulu tangkis (km h⁻¹)\\nSpeed of the shuttlecock (km h⁻¹)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"], [\"\", \"Percubaan\\nTrial\", \"1\", \"2\", \"3\", \"4\", \"5\"], [\"S\", \"\", \"254\", \"251\", \"256\", \"260\", \"253\"], [\"T\", \"\", \"252\", \"255\", \"258\", \"254\", \"255\"]]}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": true