os.','{\"form\": \"Foundation\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 3.0, \"topic\": \"Mensuration\", \"target\": \"Draw to full scale, plan of the wooden block.\", \"chapter\": \"Foundation: Mensuration\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 30, \"group_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q15\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Perimeter and Area\", \"equations\": [\"PQ : SR = 3 : 2\", \"PS = 2 \\\\times SR\"], \"variables\": [\"PQ\", \"SR\", \"PS\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"Foundation\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"15\", \"stage_index\": 1, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"3D prism\", \"given_values\": {\"PS_length\": \"2 times SR\", \"PQ_SR_ratio\": \"3:2\"}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 3.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Foundation: Mensuration\", \"question_type\": \"structured\", \"verified_form\": \"Foundation\", \"instructions_en\": [\"You are not allowed to use graph paper to answer this question. Adam needs to complete an assignment involving wooden blocks at his school. Diagram 9(a) shows a wooden block prism he received with a rectangular base PQVW. PQRS is the cross section of the prism. Given that PQ : SR = 3 : 2 and the length of PS is twice the length of SR.\", \"Draw to full scale, plan of the wooden block.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Anda tidak dibenarkan menggunakan kertas graf untuk menjawab soalan ini. Adam perlu menyelesaikan satu tugasan yang melibatkan blok kayu di sekolahnya. Rajah 9(a) menunjukkan blok kayu berbentuk prisma yang diterimanya dengan tapak segi empat tepat PQVW. PQRS adalah keratan rentas kepada prisma tersebut. Diberi bahawa PQ : SR = 3 : 2 dan panjang PS adalah dua kali panjang SR.\", \"Lukis dengan skala penuh, pelan bagi blok kayu tersebut.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 2, \"difficulty_score\": 4.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Hard\", \"verified_chapter\": \"Foundation: Mensuration\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q15_S1\", \"_diagram_public_id\": \"mathsy/question_diagrams/tsn3xp8qpnm5bzhw13hv\", \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"foundation_verified\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 3.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 5, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 1.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"A 3D wooden block prism with a rectangular base PQVW and a cross section PQRS. The diagram shows edges PQ, SR, PS with given lengths and ratios.\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.68, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"You are not allowed to use graph paper to answer this question. Adam needs to complete an assignment involving wooden blocks at his school. Diagram 9(a) shows a wooden block prism he received with a rectangular base PQVW. PQRS is the cross section of the prism. Given that PQ : SR = 3 : 2 and the length of PS is twice the length of SR.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Anda tidak dibenarkan menggunakan kertas graf untuk menjawab soalan ini. Adam perlu menyelesaikan satu tugasan yang melibatkan blok kayu di sekolahnya. Rajah 9(a) menunjukkan blok kayu berbentuk prisma yang diterimanya dengan tapak segi empat tepat PQVW. PQRS adalah keratan rentas kepada prisma tersebut. Diberi bahawa PQ : SR = 3 : 2 dan panjang PS adalah dua kali panjang SR.\"}','https://res.cloudinary.com/dfzojq6t7/image/upload/v1778507297/mathsy/question_diagrams/tsn3xp8qpnm5bzhw13hv.jpg','2026-05-11 14:21:47','Selangor_2023_Q15','Foundation','Foundation: Mensuration','foundation_verified',0.68,2,5,'Foundation: Mensuration','Foundation','Selangor_2023_Q15_S1',1,'',3.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1140,51,'15','b','i','','Structured','3D Geometry','Three-Dimensional Shapes','Foundation','Foundation: Mensuration','[\"While completing the task, Adam received another half cylindrical of wooden block that needed to be joined as shown in Diagram 9(b). The height of the half cylindrical block is equal to the length of SR.\", \"Draw to full scale, the elevation of the composite wooden block received on a vertical plane parallel to PQ as viewed from X.\"]','[\"Semasa menyiapkan tugasan tersebut, Adam telah menerima sebuah lagi blok kayu berbentuk separuh silinder yang perlu dicantumkan seperti ditunjukkan dalam Rajah 9(b). Tinggi blok separuh silinder tersebut adalah sama dengan panjang SR.\", \"Lukis dengan skala penuh, dongakan gabungan blok kayu yang diterima tersebut pada satah mencancang yang selari dengan PQ sebagaimana dilihat dari X.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\"]','[]','[\"length of SR\"]','[\"SR\", \"PQ\", \"X\"]','{}','{}','{}','[]','Draw the elevation of the composite wooden block on a vertical plane parallel to PQ as viewed from X.',1,'3D geometric figure','Moderate',4,'A composite 3D figure consisting of a rectangular block joined with a half cylindrical block, viewed from point X, with key points labeled including PQ and SR.','{\"form\": \"Foundation\", \"part\": \"b\", \"marks\": 4.0, \"topic\": \"3D Geometry\", \"target\": \"Draw the elevation of the composite wooden block on a vertical plane parallel to PQ as viewed from X.\", \"chapter\": \"Foundation: Mensuration\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"i\", \"_page_no\": 32, \"group_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q15\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Three-Dimensional Shapes\", \"equations\": [], \"variables\": [\"SR\", \"PQ\", \"X\"], \"difficulty\": \"Moderate\", \"group_form\": \"Foundation\", \"table_data\": {}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [\"length of SR\"], \"has_diagram\": true, \"question_no\": \"15\", \"stage_index\": 2, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"3D geometric figure\", \"given_values\": {}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 4.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Foundation: Mensuration\", \"question_type\": \"Structured\", \"verified_form\": \"Foundation\", \"instructions_en\": [\"While completing the task, Adam received another half cyli