 dua kali bilangan pelanggan lelaki.\"}',NULL,'2026-05-11 14:21:47','Selangor_2023_Q16','Form 4','Chapter 6: Linear Inequalities in Two Variables','verified',0.95,2,5,'Mixed','','Selangor_2023_Q16_S2',2,'',4.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1143,51,'16','c','','','structured','Financial Mathematics','Savings and Investments','Form 4','\"Chapter 10: Consumer Mathematics: Financial Management\"','[\"At the beginning of year 2019, Encik Emir obtained profit from his business. He invested his profit in two types of investments, Megah Holding and Kencana Maju. He sold all his shares at the beginning of the year 2020 and obtained RM21 400 and RM23 200 for Megah Holding and Kencana Maju investments respectively. Table 7 shows information for both investments.\", \"Which investment is more profitable in return of investment? Justify your answer.\"]','[\"Pada awal tahun 2019, Encik Emir memperolehi keuntungan daripada perniagaannya. Beliau melabur hasil keuntungannya dalam dua jenis pelaburan, Megah Holding dan Kencana Maju. Beliau menjual kesemua unit saham itu pada awal tahun 2020 dan memperolehi masing-masing RM21 400 dan RM23 200 bagi pelaburan Megah Holding dan pelaburan Kencana Maju. Jadual 7 menunjukkan maklumat bagi kedua-dua pelaburan itu.\", \"Pelaburan manakah yang memberikan nilai pulangan pelaburan yang lebih menguntungkan? Justifikasikan jawapan anda.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"]','[\"RM21 400\", \"RM23 200\", \"RM2.40\", \"RM2.60\", \"8 000\", \"RM150 setiap 6 bulan\", \"RM150 every 6 months\", \"RM250.00\", \"3.5% setahun\", \"3.5% per annum\", \"3.8% setahun\", \"3.8% per annum\"]','[]','[]','{\"Kencana Maju\": {\"Bonus\": \"3.8% per annum\", \"Dividend\": \"RM250.00\", \"Selling price\": \"RM23 200\", \"Buying price per unit\": \"RM2.60\", \"Number of shares purchase\": 8000}, \"Megah Holding\": {\"Bonus\": \"3.5% per annum\", \"Dividend\": \"RM150 every 6 months\", \"Selling price\": \"RM21 400\", \"Buying price per unit\": \"RM2.40\", \"Number of shares purchase\": 8000}}','{\"Table 7\": [[\"Pelaburan\\nInvestment\", \"Megah Holding\", \"Kencana Maju\"], [\"Harga belian seunit\\nBuying price per unit\", \"RM2.40\", \"RM2.60\"], [\"Bilangan unit saham yang dibeli\\nNumber of shares purchase\", \"8 000\", \"8 000\"], [\"Dividen\\nDividend\", \"RM150 setiap 6 bulan\\nRM150 every 6 months\", \"RM250.00\"], [\"Bonus\\nBonus\", \"3.5% setahun\\n3.5% per annum\", \"3.8% setahun\\n3.8% per annum\"]]}','{}','[]','Determine which investment is more profitable in return of investment and justify the answer.',0,'','Easy',4,'','{\"form\": \"\", \"part\": \"c\", \"marks\": 4.0, \"topic\": \"Financial Mathematics\", \"target\": \"Determine which investment is more profitable in return of investment and justify the answer.\", \"chapter\": \"\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 38, \"group_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q16\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Savings and Investments\", \"equations\": [\"RM21 400\", \"RM23 200\", \"RM2.40\", \"RM2.60\", \"8 000\", \"RM150 setiap 6 bulan\", \"RM150 every 6 months\", \"RM250.00\", \"3.5% setahun\", \"3.5% per annum\", \"3.8% setahun\", \"3.8% per annum\"], \"variables\": [], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"\", \"table_data\": {\"Table 7\": [[\"Pelaburan\\nInvestment\", \"Megah Holding\", \"Kencana Maju\"], [\"Harga belian seunit\\nBuying price per unit\", \"RM2.40\", \"RM2.60\"], [\"Bilangan unit saham yang dibeli\\nNumber of shares purchase\", \"8 000\", \"8 000\"], [\"Dividen\\nDividend\", \"RM150 setiap 6 bulan\\nRM150 every 6 months\", \"RM250.00\"], [\"Bonus\\nBonus\", \"3.5% setahun\\n3.5% per annum\", \"3.8% setahun\\n3.8% per annum\"]]}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": false, \"question_no\": \"16\", \"stage_index\": 3, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {\"Kencana Maju\": {\"Bonus\": \"3.8% per annum\", \"Dividend\": \"RM250.00\", \"Selling price\": \"RM23 200\", \"Buying price per unit\": \"RM2.60\", \"Number of shares purchase\": 8000}, \"Megah Holding\": {\"Bonus\": \"3.5% per annum\", \"Dividend\": \"RM150 every 6 months\", \"Selling price\": \"RM21 400\", \"Buying price per unit\": \"RM2.40\", \"Number of shares purchase\": 8000}}, \"marks_source\": \"marking_scheme\", \"display_marks\": 4.0, \"group_chapter\": \"Mixed\", \"question_type\": \"structured\", \"verified_form\": \"\", \"instructions_en\": [\"At the beginning of year 2019, Encik Emir obtained profit from his business. He invested his profit in two types of investments, Megah Holding and Kencana Maju. He sold all his shares at the beginning of the year 2020 and obtained RM21 400 and RM23 200 for Megah Holding and Kencana Maju investments respectively. Table 7 shows information for both investments.\", \"Which investment is more profitable in return of investment? Justify your answer.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Pada awal tahun 2019, Encik Emir memperolehi keuntungan daripada perniagaannya. Beliau melabur hasil keuntungannya dalam dua jenis pelaburan, Megah Holding dan Kencana Maju. Beliau menjual kesemua unit saham itu pada awal tahun 2020 dan memperolehi masing-masing RM21 400 dan RM23 200 bagi pelaburan Megah Holding dan pelaburan Kencana Maju. Jadual 7 menunjukkan maklumat bagi kedua-dua pelaburan itu.\", \"Pelaburan manakah yang memberikan nilai pulangan pelaburan yang lebih menguntungkan? Justifikasikan jawapan anda.\"], \"difficulty_level\": 2, \"difficulty_score\": 4.0, \"group_difficulty\": \"Hard\", \"verified_chapter\": \"\", \"exercise_stage_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q16_S3\", \"_diagram_public_id\": null, \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"needs_review\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 3.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q16_S2\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 5, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 1.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.0, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"At the beginning of year 2019, Encik Emir obtained profit from his business. He invested his profit in two types of investments, Megah Holding and Kencana Maju. He sold all his shares at the beginning of the year 2020 and obtained RM21 400 and RM23 200 for Megah Holding and Kencana Maju investments respectively. Table 7 shows information for both investments.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Pada awal tahun 2019, Encik Emir memperolehi keuntungan daripada perniagaannya. Beliau melabur hasil keuntungannya dalam dua jenis pelaburan, Megah Holding dan Kencana Maju. Beliau menjual kesemua unit saham itu pada awal tahun 2020 dan memperolehi masing-masing RM21 400 dan RM23 200 bagi pelaburan Megah Holding dan pelaburan Kencana Maju. Jadual 7 menunjukkan maklumat bagi kedua-dua pelaburan itu.\"}',NULL,'2026-05-11 14:21:47','Selangor_2023_Q16','Form 4','Chapter 10: Consume Mathematics: Financial Management','needs_review',0.00,2,5,'Chapter 10: Consume Mathematics: Financial Management','Form 4','Selangor_2023_Q16_S2',3,'',4.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1144,51,'17','a','i','','Structured','Numbers and Arithmetic','Rational Numbers','Form 4','Chapter 2: Number Bases','[\"Alex Tan is a degree holder from Putra University of Malaysia (UPM) has a high interest in agriculture like his father. After attending a Young Agropreneurs Programme, Alex Tan wanted to expand his career by planning to buy a modern tractor with a very reasonable price. Diagram 10 shows the price of two tractors in two different number bases.\", \"Express RM101 266₉ to a number in base ten.\"]','[\"Alex Tan, seorang graduan Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) menceburi bidang pertanian mengikut jejak langkah ayahnya. Setelah menghadiri Program Agropreneur Muda, Alex Tan ingin mengembangkan potensi kerjayanya dengan bercadang untuk membeli sebuah traktor yang moden dengan harga yang sangat berpatutan. Rajah 10 menunjukkan harga bagi dua buah traktor dalam dua asas nombor yang berbeza.\", \"Ungkapkan RM101 266₉ kepada nombor dal