am_public_id\": null, \"requires_next_page\": false, \"classification_status\": \"foundation_verified\", \"difficulty_core_score\": 2.0, \"unlock_after_stage_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q17_S3\", \"group_difficulty_level\": 5, \"difficulty_visual_score\": 0.0, \"visual_semantic_summary\": \"\", \"classification_confidence\": 0.68, \"introductory_instructions_en\": \"Alex Tan plans to have water catchment pond in the shape of regular hexagon with the side of 12 m.\", \"introductory_instructions_ms\": \"Alex Tan bercadang untuk mengadakan kolam tadahan air berbentuk heksagon sekata dengan sisinya 12 m.\"}',NULL,'2026-05-11 14:21:47','Selangor_2023_Q17','Foundation','Foundation: Mensuration','foundation_verified',0.68,1,5,'Mixed','','Selangor_2023_Q17_S4',4,'',3.00,'marking_scheme',1),(1159,51,'16','a','','','Structured','Algebra','Algebraic Expressions','Form 5','Chapter 2: Matrices','[\"Encik Emir has a shop selling various types of Hipster Coffee. On a particular weekend, he took part in Pesta Heboh for two days. He sold his Hipster Coffee in two different packages. Table 6 shows information about the packages.\", \"On the first day, he sold 35 of Economy\'s packages and 45 of Premium\'s packages with a total sale of RM890. On the second day, the number of Economy\'s packages sold was doubled compared to its sale on the first day and the number of Premium\'s packages sold were 2/3 compared to its sale on the first day. His total sales during the Pesta Heboh were RM1 950. By using the matrix method, calculate the package price, in RM, K and L.\"]','[\"Encik Emir mempunyai sebuah kedai yang menjual pelbagai jenis Kopi Hipster. Pada suatu hujung minggu tertentu, dia mengambil bahagian dalam suatu Pesta Heboh yang berlangsung selama dua hari. Dia menjual Kopi Hipster dalam dua pakej yang berlainan. Jadual 6 menunjukkan maklumat pakej tersebut.\", \"Pada hari pertama, dia berjaya menjual 35 pakej Ekonomi dan 45 pakej Premium dengan hasil jualan RM890. Pada hari kedua, jualan pakej Ekonomi adalah dua kali jualannya pada hari pertama manakala jualan pakej Premium adalah 2/3 daripada jualannya pada hari pertama. Jumlah jualannya sepanjang Pesta Heboh itu ialah RM1 950. Dengan menggunakan kaedah matriks, hitung harga pakej, dalam RM, K dan L.\"]','[\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"]','[\"2/3\"]','[]','[\"K\", \"L\"]','{\"day_1_total_sales\": 890, \"day_1_economy_packages\": 35, \"day_1_premium_packages\": 45, \"day_2_economy_packages\": \"2 x day_1_economy_packages\", \"day_2_premium_packages\": \"(2/3) x day_1_premium_packages\", \"total_sales_pesta_heboh\": 1950}','{\"Table 6\": [[\"Pakej\", \"Jenis Kopi Hipster\", \"Harga Per Pakej (RM)\"], [\"Economy\", \"2 Latte & 2 Cappuccino\", \"K\"], [\"Premium\", \"2 Butterscotch & 2 Macadamia\", \"L\"]]}','{}','[]','Calculate the package price, in RM, K and L using the matrix method.',0,'','Easy',5,'','{\"form\": \"Form 5\", \"part\": \"a\", \"marks\": 5.0, \"topic\": \"Algebra\", \"target\": \"Calculate the package price, in RM, K and L using the matrix method.\", \"chapter\": \"Chapter 2: Matrices\", \"options\": [], \"subpart\": \"\", \"_page_no\": 34, \"group_id\": \"Selangor_2023_Q16\", \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"], \"subtopic\": \"Algebraic Expressions\", \"equations\": [\"2/3\"], \"variables\": [\"K\", \"L\"], \"difficulty\": \"Easy\", \"group_form\": \"\", \"table_data\": {\"Table 6\": [[\"Pakej\", \"Jenis Kopi Hipster\", \"Harga Per Pakej (RM)\"], [\"Economy\", \"2 Latte & 2 Cappuccino\", \"K\"], [\"Premium\", \"2 Butterscotch & 2 Macadamia\", \"L\"]]}, \"constraints\": {}, \"expressions\": [], \"has_diagram\": false, \"question_no\": \"16\", \"stage_index\": 1, \"sub_subpart\": \"\", \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {\"day_1_total_sales\": 890, \"day_1_economy_packages\": 35, \"day_1_premium_packages\": 45, \"day_2_economy_packages\": \"2 x day_1_economy_packages\", \"day_2_premium_packages\": \"(2/3) x day_1_premium_packages\", \"total_sales_pesta_heboh