explanation_bm\": \"Tukarkan 24 kepada asas 8: 24 = 3 \\\\times 8 + 0, jadi jawapannya ialah $30_8$. Oleh itu, pilihan C adalah betul.\", \"explanation_en\": \"Convert 24 to base 8: 24 = 3 \\\\times 8 + 0, so the answer is $30_8$. Therefore, option C is correct.\"}',0,0,NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-18 07:07:33','2026-05-18 07:30:54',NULL),(20,17766,716420,'question','question:542',NULL,NULL,542,'k1_mcq_variant','english','{\"options\": [{\"label\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"12\", \"text_ms\": \"12\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"13\", \"text_ms\": \"13\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"14\", \"text_ms\": \"14\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"15\", \"text_ms\": \"15\", \"image_path\": \"\"}], \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"image_0\", \"text_1\"], \"image_path\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/dn04h9kz9/image/upload/v1778184568/f363ca09-5df4-46bd-95f8-017a6ad13207.png\", \"image_urls\": [\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dn04h9kz9/image/upload/v1778184568/f363ca09-5df4-46bd-95f8-017a6ad13207.png\"], \"table_data\": {}, \"has_diagram\": 1, \"diagram_type\": \"photograph of a plate of fried noodles and a cup of drink with prices in base two\", \"given_values\": {}, \"display_marks\": 1, \"instructions_en\": [\"Diagram 2 shows the price, in base two, of a plate of fried noodles and a cup of drink sold at a stall.\", \"Which of the following is the total price of the food and drink, in base ten?\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Rajah 2 menunjukkan harga, dalam asas dua, bagi sepinggan mi goreng dan secawan air minuman yang dijual di sebuah gerai.\", \"Antara yang berikut, yang manakah jumlah harga makanan dan minuman tersebut, dalam asas sepuluh?\"]}','{\"max_score\": 1, \"final_answer\": \"C\", \"explanation_bm\": \"Jumlah harga yang ditunjukkan dalam rajah ialah $1100_2$, iaitu $12_{10}$. Oleh itu, jawapan yang betul ialah C.\", \"explanation_en\": \"The total price shown in the diagram is $1100_2$, which is 