el\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"If x is a factor of 8, then x is a factor of 4.\", \"text_ms\": \"Jika x ialah faktor bagi 8, maka x ialah faktor bagi 4.\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"If x is not a factor of 4, then x is not a factor of 8.\", \"text_ms\": \"Jika x bukan faktor bagi 4, maka x bukan faktor bagi 8.\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"If x is a factor of 4, then x is not a factor of 8.\", \"text_ms\": \"Jika x ialah faktor bagi 4, maka x bukan faktor bagi 8.\", \"image_path\": \"\"}], \"sequence\": [\"text_0\"], \"image_path\": \"\", \"image_urls\": [], \"table_data\": {}, \"has_diagram\": 0, \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {}, \"display_marks\": 1, \"instructions_en\": [\"Given implication ‘If x is a factor of 4, then x is a factor of 8’.\", \"Which of the following is the contrapositive?\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Diberi implikasi ‘Jika x ialah faktor bagi 4, maka x ialah faktor bagi 8’.\", \"Antara yang berikut, yang manakah kontrapositif?\"]}','{\"max_score\": 1, \"final_answer\": \"A\", \"explanation_bm\": \"Implikasi diberi ialah: Jika x ialah faktor bagi 4, maka x ialah faktor bagi 8. Kontrapositif dibentuk dengan menukar tertib dan menafikan kedua-dua bahagian: Jika x bukan faktor bagi 8, maka x bukan faktor bagi 4. Jadi jawapan yang betul ialah A.\", \"explanation_en\": \"The implication is: If x is a factor of 4, then x is a factor of 8. The contrapositive is formed by reversing and negating both parts: If x is not a factor of 8, then x is not a factor of 4. So the correct option is A.\"}',0,0,NULL,NULL,'queued','2026-05-18 07:43:04','2026-05-18 07:43:04',NULL),(26,17766,716372,'question','question:557',NULL,NULL,557,'k1_mcq_variant','english','{\"options\": [{\"label\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"p = 5\", \"text_ms\": \"p = 5\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"p ≠ 5\", \"text_ms\": \"p ≠ 5\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"p × 4 = 20\", \"text_ms\": \"p × 4 = 20\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"p × 4 ≠ 20\", \"text_ms\": \"p × 4 ≠ 20\", \"image_path\": \"\"}], \"sequence\": [\"text_0\", \"table_0\", \"text_1\"], \"image_path\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/dn04h9kz9/image/upload/v1778184774/1f90bfc9-0523-4fca-b616-fcf69f682f6b.png\", \"image_urls\": [\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dn04h9kz9/image/upload/v1778184774/1f90bfc9-0523-4fca-b616-fcf69f682f6b.png\"], \"table_data\": {\"rows\": [[\"Premis 1 / Premise 1\", \"Jika p × 5 = 30, maka p = 6 / If p × 5 = 30, then p = 6\"], [\"Premis 2 / Premise 2\", \"p ≠ 6\"], [\"Kesimpulan / Conclusion\", \"…………………………\"]], \"headers\": [\"\", \"\"]}, \"has_diagram\": 1, \"diagram_type\": \"deductive argument table\", \"given_values\": {}, \"display_marks\": 1, \"instructions_en\": [\"Diagram 17 shows a form of a deductive argument.\", \"Which of the following is the correct conclusion for the argument?\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Rajah 17 menunjukkan satu bentuk hujah deduktif.\", \"Antara berikut, manakah merupakan kesimpulan yang tepat bagi hujah tersebut?\"]}','{\"max_score\": 1, \"final_answer\": \"D\", \"explanation_bm\": \"Daripada premis, jika p × 4 = 20 maka p = 5, tetapi premis kedua menyatakan p ≠ 5. Oleh itu, kesimpulan yang betul ialah p × 4 ≠ 20.\", \"explanation_en\": \"From the premises, if p × 4 = 20 then p = 5, but the second premise says p ≠ 5. Therefore, the correct conclusion is p × 4 ≠ 20.\"}',0,0,NULL,NULL,'queued','2026-05-18 07:43:24','2026-05-18 07:43:24',NULL),(27,17766,716372,'question','question:653',NULL,NULL,653,'k1_mcq_variant','english','{\"options\": [{\"label\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"If 8 + 2 × 5 = 18, then 2 × 5 = 10.\", \"text_ms\": \"Jika 8 + 2 × 5 = 18, maka 2 × 5 = 10.\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"All the factors of 18 can be divided by 3.\", \"text_ms\": \"Semua faktor bagi 18 boleh dibahagi dengan 3.\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"If x < y, then 2x < 2y.\", \"text_ms\": \"Jika x < y, maka 2x < 2y.\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"x^2 - y^2 = (x - y)(x + y)\", \"text_ms\": \"x^2 - y^2 = (x - y)(x + y)\", \"image_path\": \"\"}], \"sequence\": [\"text_0\"], \"image_path\": \"\", \"image_urls\": [], \"table_data\": {}, \"has_diagram\": 0, \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {}, \"display_marks\": 1, \"instructions_en\": [\"Which of the following statements is false?\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Pernyataan manakah yang palsu?\"]}','{\"max_score\": 1, \"final_answer\": \"B\", \"explanation_bm\": \"Pilihan B adalah palsu kerana bukan semua faktor bagi 18 boleh dibahagi dengan 3. Contohnya, 1 dan 2 ialah faktor bagi 18, tetapi kedua-duanya tidak boleh dibahagi dengan 3.\", \"explanation_en\": \"Option B is false because not all factors of 18 are divisible by 3. For example, 1 and 2 are factors of 18, but neither is divisible by 3.\"}',0,0,NULL,NULL,'queued','2026-05-18 07:43:36','2026-05-18 07:43:36',NULL),(28,17766,716374,'question','question:625',NULL,NULL,625,'k1_mcq_variant','english','{\"options\": [{\"label\": \"A\", \"text_en\": \"{4, 6}\", \"text_ms\": \"{4, 6}\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"B\", \"text_en\": \"{1, 2, 8, 9}\", \"text_ms\": \"{1, 2, 8, 9}\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"C\", \"text_en\": \"{1, 4, 6, 9}\", \"text_ms\": \"{1, 4, 6, 9}\", \"image_path\": \"\"}, {\"label\": \"D\", \"text_en\": \"{2, 4, 6, 8}\", \"text_ms\": \"{2, 4, 6, 8}\", \"image_path\": \"\"}], \"sequence\": [\"text_0\"], \"image_path\": \"\", \"image_urls\": [], \"table_data\": {}, \"has_diagram\": 0, \"diagram_type\": \"\", \"given_values\": {\"A\": \"{1, 4, 6, 9}\", \"B\": \"{2, 4, 6, 8}\"}, \"display_marks\": 1, \"instructions_en\": [\"It is given that set A = {1, 4, 6, 9} and set B = {2, 4, 6, 8}. List all the elements of set A ∩ B.\"], \"instructions_ms\": [\"Diberi bahawa set A = {1, 4, 6, 9} dan set B = {2, 4, 6, 8}. Senaraikan semua unsur bagi set A ∩ B.\"]}',